            "id": "20260805A0DSZL00",
            "title": "中国太保寿险北京分公司施艳：AI辅助审核可行性，有待合规与技术共同验证",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OoDIJPiyBoJDtP6yFzZJ7uCRn1M3KPwiY-_HbMiUmZ-7wAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260805A0DSZL00",
